ssignment, quiz, project, sessional grades are regularly upgraded and maintained by the respective course TA/Instructor and are available online. It is the responsibility of the student to check his/her grades and report any discrepancy to the Academic Office. Grades will not be changed if the student fails to report a grading discrepancy in an appropriate span of time.

