olders in the merit list of NU admission merit list of each campus. The University awards certificates and cash prizes to those undergraduate students, who are the Top Three in their department. Students are selected from each of the four years of every degree program. This scholarship is for four years of un-interrupted studies with standard courses (core and elective), labs and final year projects of the degree offered by the department in a semester to a batch with

