llowing lab rules. 18. Any facility offered in the lab can be revoked/denied without prior notification. 19. All users must observe Lab rules. Breach of any of these rules would result in a fine of Rs. 500/- and/or may result in disciplinary action and the loss of lab privileges disabling of user account.

